        "content": "     1→# agentdaily — LLM Context File\n     2→\n     3→> AI-powered daily research aggregator for the agentic coding ecosystem.\n     4→> Uses Claude Agent SDK to discover products, track updates, and compile insights via configured workflows.\n     5→\n     6→## Project Overview\n     7→\n     8→**Goal**: Automate daily research reports about agentic coding tools by orchestrating Claude Agent SDK workflows that search, aggregate, and format findings into markdown/HTML outputs.\n     9→\n    10→**Core Flow**: CLI → Workflow → Agent → Prompts → Output Files\n    11→\n    12→---\n    13→\n    14→## Source Files\n    15→\n    16→### src/cli.ts\n    17→Entry point. Parses CLI args via yargs, routes to workflows.\n    18→\n    19→```typescript\n    20→async function main(): Promise<void>\n    21→```\n    22→- Commands: `$0` (default update), `start [date]`, `index`\n    23→- Options: `--workspace <path>`, `--list` (read-only mode)\n    24→\n    25→### src/agent/ClaudeAgent.ts\n    26→Wrapper for `@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk`.\n    27→\n    28→```typescript\n    29→interface AgentConfig {\n    30→  model?: string;        // Default: 'claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022'\n    31→  maxTurns?: number;     // Default: 30\n    32→  cwd?: string;          // Working directory\n    33→}\n    34→\n    35→class ClaudeAgent {\n    36→  constructor(config?: Partial<AgentConfig>)\n    37→  async run(systemPrompt: string, userPrompt: string): Promise<string>\n    38→}\n    39→```\n    40→- Configures MCP server for web search\n    41→- Streams messages, logs execution summary (cost, duration, turns)\n    42→\n    43→### src/agent/prompts.ts\n    44→System prompt generator for research context.\n    45→\n    46→```typescript\n    47→function getSystemPrompt(): string\n    48→```\n    49→- Returns static prompt defining agent as agentic coding researcher\n    50→\n    51→### src/config/tasks.ts\n    52→Loads task configuration from `config/tasks.json`.\n    53→\n    54→```typescript\n    55→interface TasksConfig { tasks: string[] }\n    56→\n    57→function loadTasksConfig(): TasksConfig\n    58→const tasksConfig: TasksConfig\n    59→```\n    60→- Tasks reference prompt file paths in `prompts/` directory\n    61→\n    62→### src/types/index.ts\n    63→Core type definitions.\n    64→\n    65→```typescript\n    66→interface ResearchResult {\n    67→  newProducts: ProductDiscovery[];\n    68→  whitelistUpdates: ProductUpdate[];\n    69→  insights: TechnicalInsight[];\n    70→  generatedAt: string;\n    71→}\n    72→\n    73→interface ProductDiscovery {\n    74→  title: string;\n    75→  description: string;\n    76→  url?: string;\n    77→  source: string;\n    78→  category?: string;\n    79→  relevanceScore?: number;\n    80→}\n    81→\n    82→interface ProductUpdate {\n    83→  productName: string;\n    84→  title: string;\n    85→  description: string;\n    86→  updateType: 'feature' | 'bugfix' | 'announcement' | 'release';\n    87→  url?: string;\n    88→  date?: string;\n    89→}\n    90→\n    91→interface TechnicalInsight {\n    92→  title: string;\n    93→  description: string;\n    94→  author?: string;\n    95→  source: string;\n    96→  url?: string;\n    97→  topics: string[];\n    98→  type: 'technical' | 'opinion' | 'tutorial' | 'discussion';\n    99→}\n   100→```\n   101→\n   102→### src/utils/workspace.ts\n   103→Workspace directory management.\n   104→\n   105→```typescript\n   106→function getWorkspaceDir(customPath?: string): string\n   107→function getCurrentDateString(): string  // Returns YYYY-MM-DD\n   108→```\n   109→- Auto-creates `updates/{YYYY-MM-DD}/` if no custom path\n   110→\n   111→### src/utils/formatter.ts\n   112→Output formatting utilities.\n   113→\n   114→```typescript\n   115→function formatAsMarkdown(result: ResearchResult): string\n   116→function formatForConsole(result: ResearchResult): void\n   117→```\n   118→- Handles null/undefined arrays gracefully\n   119→- Generates structured markdown with sections\n   120→\n   121→### src/workflows/research.ts\n   122→Core research orchestration.\n   123→\n   124→```typescript\n   125→function parseAgentResponse<T>(response: string, taskName: string): T\n   126→function getTaskName(promptFile: string): string\n   127→async function runResearchWorkflow(workspaceDir?: string): Promise<ResearchResult>\n   128→```\n   129→- Iterates through configured tasks\n   130→- Executes agent with each prompt\n   131→- Aggregates results into ResearchResult\n   132→\n   133→### src/workflows/update.ts\n   134→Main update workflow with file I/O.\n   135→\n   136→```typescript\n   137→async function runUpdate(workspacePath?: string): Promise<void>\n   138→async function updateManifest(): Promise<void>  // Internal\n   139→async function generateIndexPage(): Promise<void>  // Internal\n   140→async function runGenerateIndex(): Promise<void>  // Public helper\n   141→```\n   142→- Writes `report.md`, `data.json` to workspace\n   143→- Updates `updates/manifest.json` with available dates\n   144→- Generates `updates/index.html` via agent\n   145→\n   146→### src/workflows/list.ts\n   147→Read-only preview workflow.\n   148→\n   149→```typescript\n   150→async function runList(): Promise<void>\n   151→```\n   152→- Runs research, outputs to console only (no file writes)\n   153→\n   154→---\n   155→\n   156→## Configuration & Data Files\n   157→\n   158→### config/tasks.json\n   159→```json\n   160→{ \"tasks\": [\"prompts/task-new-product.prompty\", ...] }\n   161→```\n   162→Array of prompt file paths to execute sequentially.\n   163→\n   164→### prompts/*.md\n   165→Prompt templates with `{INSERT_CURRENT_DATE}` placeholders.\n   166→- `task-new-product.prompty` — Discover new tools (last 14 days) using prompty layout\n   167→- `whitelist-updates-prompt.md` — Track curated product updates\n   168→- `insights-prompt.md` — Gather thought leader opinions\n   169→- `html-report-prompt.md` — Generate HTML from markdown\n   170→- `index-page-prompt.md` — Build weekly index page\n   171→- `auto-update-prompt.md` — CI/CD automation instructions\n   172→\n   173→### templates/updates-assets/\n   174→Static assets for generated HTML pages.\n   175→- `base.css` — Medium-style black/white design system\n   176→- `base.js` — Navigation injection from manifest\n   177→\n   178→---\n   179→\n   180→## Architecture Map\n   181→\n   182→```\n   183→                              ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   184→                              │              CLI (cli.ts)               │\n   185→                              │  Commands: update | start | index       │\n   186→                              └──────────────────┬──────────────────────┘\n   187→                                                 │\n   188→                    ┌────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┐\n   189→                    │                            │                            │\n   190→                    ▼                            ▼                            ▼\n   191→          ┌─────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐         ┌─────────────────┐\n   192→          │   list.ts       │         │   update.ts     │         │ index (update)  │\n   193→          │  (read-only)    │         │ (write files)   │         │  (regenerate)   │\n   194→          └────────┬────────┘         └────────┬────────┘         └────────┬────────┘\n   195→                   │                           │                           │\n   196→                   └───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┘\n   197→                                               │\n   198→                                               ▼\n   199→                                    ┌─────────────────────┐\n   200→                                    │    research.ts      │\n   201→                                    │ (task orchestrator) │\n   202→                                    └──────────┬──────────┘\n   203→                                               │\n   204→                           ┌───────────────────┴───────────────────┐\n   205→                           │                                       │\n   206→                           ▼                                       ▼\n   207→                 ┌─────────────────┐                    ┌─────────────────┐\n   208→                 │  tasks.ts       │                    │  ClaudeAgent.ts │\n   209→                 │ (load config)   │                    │  (SDK wrapper)  │\n   210→                 └────────┬────────┘                    └────────┬────────┘\n   211→                          │                                      │\n   212→                          ▼                                      ▼\n   213→                 ┌─────────────────┐                    ┌─────────────────┐\n   214→                 │ config/tasks.json│                   │ Claude Agent SDK│\n   215→                 └─────────────────┘                    │ + MCP Web Search│\n   216→                                                        └─────────────────┘\n   217→\n   218→  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   219→  │                              OUTPUT FLOW                                     │\n   220→  │                                                                              │\n   221→  │   research.ts → ResearchResult → formatter.ts → Markdown/Console            │\n   222→  │                                                                              │\n   223→  │   update.ts   → updates/{date}/report.md                                    │\n   224→  │              → updates/{date}/data.json                                     │\n   225→  │              → updates/manifest.json                                        │\n   226→  │              → updates/index.html                                           │\n   227→  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   228→\n   229→  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n   230→  │                            TYPE RELATIONSHIPS                               │\n   231→  │                                                                              │\n   232→  │   TasksConfig ─────► prompts/*.md paths                                     │\n   233→  │        │                  │                                                  │\n   234→  │        ▼                  ▼                                                  │\n   235→  │   research.ts ────► ClaudeAgent.run() ────► JSON response                   │\n   236→  │        │                                         │                          │\n   237→  │        ▼                                         ▼                          │\n   238→  │   ResearchResult ◄─────── parseAgentResponse<T>()                           │\n   239→  │        │                                                                     │\n   240→  │        ├──► ProductDiscovery[]                                              │\n   241→  │        ├──► ProductUpdate[]                                                  │\n   242→  │        └──► TechnicalInsight[]                                              │\n   243→  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n   244→```\n   245→\n   246→---\n   247→\n   248→## Code Style Guide\n   249→\n   250→| Aspect | Convention |\n   251→|--------|------------|\n   252→| Language | TypeScript (strict mode) |\n   253→| Target | ES2022, CommonJS modules |\n   254→| Async | Async/await throughout, no callbacks |\n   255→| Error Handling | Try/catch with console logging, throw to propagate |\n   256→| Null Safety | Explicit null checks, default empty arrays |\n   257→| Exports | Named exports, no default exports |\n   258→| Naming | camelCase functions, PascalCase types/classes |\n   259→| Comments | JSDoc for public functions only |\n   260→|